Is there anything

875
00:37:53,400 --> 00:37:54,330
we can do for you?

876
00:37:55,630 --> 00:37:56,320
You guys?

877
00:37:59,760 --> 00:38:01,020
I'm a straightforward

878
00:38:01,420 --> 00:38:02,420
person.

879
00:38:05,840 --> 00:38:06,480
Forget it. Forget it.

880
00:38:06,480 --> 00:38:07,440
Wait...

881
00:38:07,800 --> 00:38:08,760
If you get arrested,

882
00:38:08,760 --> 00:38:09,890
who will defend you?

883
00:38:12,190 --> 00:38:13,120
Probably no one.

884
00:38:14,510 --> 00:38:15,440
In Nanyu County,

885
00:38:15,630 --> 00:38:17,490
there are only 3 lawyers in total.

886
00:38:17,630 --> 00:38:18,480
Wang Benshan

887
00:38:18,710 --> 00:38:19,570
and Qin Zhigao.

888
00:38:20,070 --> 00:38:21,200
One won't defend me,

889
00:38:21,550 --> 00:38:22,280
and the other

890
00:38:22,480 --> 00:38:23,610
can't defend at all.

891
00:38:27,880 --> 00:38:28,880
Let me defend you.

892
00:38:30,800 --> 00:38:31,480
You?

893
00:38:32,630 --> 00:38:34,160
You don't have a lawyer's license.

894
00:38:34,160 --> 00:38:34,880
I can still be

895
00:38:34,880 --> 00:38:35,940
your lay defender.

896
00:38:40,150 --> 00:38:41,190
I know you think

897
00:38:41,190 --> 00:38:43,280
we college students are overly ambitious,

898
00:38:43,280 --> 00:38:44,590
impulsive, and naive,

899
00:38:44,670 --> 00:38:45,070
right?

900
00:38:45,670 --> 00:38:46,880
But I'm still better than Wang Benshan,

901
00:38:46,880 --> 00:38:47,410
right?

902
00:38:48,030 --> 00:38:48,890
Think about it.

903
00:38:50,880 --> 00:38:51,210
Okay.

904
00:38:52,030 --> 00:38:53,400
Then I'll take you

905
00:38:53,840 --> 00:38:54,900
as my lay defender.

906
00:38:55,550 --> 00:38:55,880
Okay.

907
00:38:57,230 --> 00:38:58,630
Sign a power of attorney.

908
00:38:58,840 --> 00:39:00,300
Do you have any paper here?

909
00:39:01,440 --> 00:39:02,400
Don't touch my bag.

910
00:39:02,400 --> 00:39:04,150
It's full of Qiao Zhiliang's case files.

911
00:39:04,150 --> 00:39:05,280
Come back to the Advisory Office with me.

912
00:39:05,280 --> 00:39:06,800
I'll sign it in my office.

913
00:39:07,190 --> 00:39:08,850
What if you can't make it back?

914
00:39:12,920 --> 00:39:14,380
That won't happen, right?

915
00:39:16,630 --> 00:39:17,490
How about this?

916
00:39:17,550 --> 00:39:18,610
Write it on my vest.

917
00:39:22,280 --> 00:39:23,080
Write it here.

918
00:39:48,710 --> 00:39:49,700
Are you two okay?

919
00:39:50,400 --> 00:39:50,840
Yes.

920
00:39:51,400 --> 00:39:51,800
Yes.

921
00:39:52,510 --> 00:39:53,400
Push harder.

922
00:39:55,670 --> 00:39:56,400
Are you okay?

923
00:39:56,840 --> 00:39:57,300
Come on.

924
00:40:00,710 --> 00:40:01,840
We're almost there.

925
00:40:03,280 --> 00:40:03,800
Xia,

926
00:40:04,280 --> 00:40:05,010
are you okay?

927
00:40:07,360 --> 00:40:08,390
If you're feeling unwell,

928
00:40:08,390 --> 00:40:09,350
just wait here.

929
00:40:21,230 --> 00:40:22,160
Director Xiang.

930
00:40:22,630 --> 00:40:25,280
Those whose parents are dead
are considered orphans.

931
00:40:25,280 --> 00:40:26,170
And for orphans,

932
00:40:26,170 --> 00:40:27,840
every region has its own policies.

933
00:40:27,840 --> 00:40:29,030
The civil affairs department

934
00:40:29,030 --> 00:40:30,760
will provide child support
based on the local

935
00:40:30,760 --> 00:40:32,110
average living standard.

936
00:40:32,110 --> 00:40:32,840
In this way,

937
00:40:33,110 --> 00:40:33,960
the 3 children

938
00:40:34,190 --> 00:40:35,590
will have their basic needs covered,

939
00:40:35,590 --> 00:40:36,070
right?

940
00:40:37,590 --> 00:40:38,550
In the village,

941
00:40:39,360 --> 00:40:41,480
there are plenty of unattended children.

942
00:40:41,480 --> 00:40:43,210
That's not the way to look at it.

943
00:40:43,440 --> 00:40:45,400
These 3 children have no parents.

944
00:40:45,710 --> 00:40:47,320
If the state doesn't take care of them,

945
00:40:47,320 --> 00:40:48,920
how are they going to grow up?

946
00:40:49,440 --> 00:40:51,170
If they go astray later in life,

947
00:40:51,190 --> 00:40:53,670
won't that just be more problems
for the state?

948
00:40:53,670 --> 00:40:55,200
I have one more suggestion.

949
00:40:55,600 --> 00:40:57,410
Have the brigade hold and manage

950
00:40:57,440 --> 00:40:58,670
the money.

951
00:40:59,360 --> 00:41:00,440
When it's needed,

952
00:41:00,840 --> 00:41:02,960
their grandmother can come to the brigade
to collect it.

953
00:41:02,960 --> 00:41:04,760
This provides dual protection.

954
00:41:05,110 --> 00:41:07,000
You not only handle the cases,

955
00:41:07,400 --> 00:41:09,800
but also take care of things
for the convicts after they're gone.

956
00:41:09,800 --> 00:41:11,400
Qiu Agui is truly fortunate

957
00:41:11,670 --> 00:41:13,670
to have met someone like you.

958
00:41:24,960 --> 00:41:26,150
Liang, wait a moment.

959
00:41:26,150 --> 00:41:26,630
Come in.

960
00:41:28,590 --> 00:41:29,590
Court Pres. Ding.

961
00:41:30,150 --> 00:41:31,010
Zhang, come in.

962
00:41:31,180 --> 00:41:32,000
Please take the measurements first.

963
00:41:32,000 --> 00:41:33,060
What's this about?

964
00:41:34,070 --> 00:41:35,190
I was thinking we don't have enough money

965
00:41:35,190 --> 00:41:36,320
to replace the door.

966
00:41:36,370 --> 00:41:37,480
We could just patch up the gaps

967
00:41:37,480 --> 00:41:38,920
and reinforce the old door.

968
00:41:38,920 --> 00:41:39,920
Replace the door?

969
00:41:40,590 --> 00:41:43,320
Why would I want to replace the door
for no reason?

970
00:41:43,630 --> 00:41:45,150
Yesterday, didn't you tell me

971
00:41:45,150 --> 00:41:45,440
to replace...

972
00:41:45,440 --> 00:41:46,710
Get out.

973
00:41:47,360 --> 00:41:48,190
Close the door!

974
00:41:48,190 --> 00:41:48,810
Yes.

975
00:41:49,610 --> 00:41:51,070
Liang, please continue.

976
00:41:52,030 --> 00:41:52,480
What?

977
00:41:53,760 --> 00:41:55,820
Arresting Li Xiang is absurd enough.

978
00:41:56,030 --> 00:41:58,360
Now they want to catch Hong Zhansheng too?

979
00:42:02,360 --> 00:42:03,580
Zhang, are you busy?

980
00:42:34,550 --> 00:42:36,000
The review
for Qiao Zhiliang's death penalty

981
00:42:36,000 --> 00:42:36,480
has been approved.

982
00:42:36,480 --> 00:42:37,480
Did you know that?

983
00:42:39,710 --> 00:42:42,230
The county
is holding a public sentencing rally.

984
00:42:42,230 --> 00:42:44,430
They're adding Qiu Agui and another one

985
00:42:46,710 --> 00:42:47,640
to make it three,

986
00:42:47,710 --> 00:42:49,110
like the Peach Garden Oath.

987
00:42:49,110 --> 00:42:50,400
Those three will all be executed
after the sentencing.
